      <div class="hud-item">
        <span class="hud-key">EDGE_HARDWARE:</span>
        <span class="hud-val hud-val-purple">RUNS ON COMPACT 12W CHIPS (ZERO CLOUD EGRESS)</span>
      </div>
      <span class="hud-sep">·</span>
      <div class="hud-item">
        <span class="hud-key">VEHICLE_INGESTION:</span>
        <span class="hud-val hud-val-cyan">100,000+ SENSOR SIGNALS/SEC (ZERO LOSS)</span>
      </div>
      <span class="hud-sep">·</span>
      <div class="hud-item">
