        <span class="hud-key">PUBLIC_HEALTH:</span>
        <span class="hud-val hud-val-purple">236 FRONTLINE DUTIES DIGITIZED (20+ CLINICS)</span>
      </div>
      <span class="hud-sep">·</span>
      <div class="hud-item">
        <span class="hud-key">DISASTER_ROUTING:</span>
        <span class="hud-val hud-val-cyan">REBUILDS FLOOD ROAD MAPS (-38.4% EVAC TIME)</span>
      </div>
      <span class="hud-sep">·</span>
      <div class="hud-item">
        <span class="hud-key">TEST_PASS_RATE:</span>
        <span class="hud-val hud-val-green">99.4% AUTOMATED CI CHECKS (708/712 PASS)</span>
      </div>
      <span class="hud-sep">·</span>
      <div class="hud-item">
        <span class="hud-key">STUDENT_MENTORSHIP:</span>
        <span class="hud-val hud-val-purple">500+ ENGINEERS GUIDED (PCCOE CODING CLUB)</span>
      </div>
      <span class="hud-sep">·</span>

      <!-- Duplicate stream for continuous loop -->
      <div class="hud-item">
        <span class="hud-key">ACTION_SAFETY:</span>
        <span class="hud-val hud-val-cyan">VERIFIED IN &lt; 1 MS (0.0377 ms GATING)</span>
      </div>
      <span class="hud-sep">·</span>
      <div class="hud-item">
        <span class="hud-key">COMPUTE_EFFICIENCY:</span>
        <span class="hud-val hud-val-green">99.9% LESS ATTENTION COMPUTE (QUAD-BRANCH)</span>
      </div>
      <span class="hud-sep">·</span>
      <div class="hud-item">
        <span class="hud-key">EDGE_HARDWARE:</span>
        <span class="hud-val hud-val-purple">RUNS ON COMPACT 12W CHIPS (ZERO CLOUD EGRESS)</span>
      </div>
      <span class="hud-sep">·</span>
      <div class="hud-item">
        <span class="hud-key">VEHICLE_INGESTION:</span>
        <span class="hud-val hud-val-cyan">100,000+ SENSOR SIGNALS/SEC (ZERO LOSS)</span>
      </div>
      <span class="hud-sep">·</span>
      <div class="hud-item">
        <span class="hud-key">MODEL_DEFENSE:</span>
        <span class="hud-val hud-val-green">MATHEMATICAL TAMPER DEFENSE (LIPSCHITZ BOUNDS)</span>
      </div>
      <span class="hud-sep">·</span>
      <div class="hud-item">
        <span class="hud-key">PUBLIC_HEALTH:</span>
        <span class="hud-val hud-val-purple">236 FRONTLINE DUTIES DIGITIZED (20+ CLINICS)</span>
      </div>
      <span class="hud-sep">·</span>
      <div class="hud-item">
        <span class="hud-key">DISASTER_ROUTING:</span>
        <span class="hud-val hud-val-cyan">REBUILDS FLOOD ROAD MAPS (-38.4% EVAC TIME)</span>
